  "editorReview": {
    "text": "This reconstruction of the Endurance ordeal delivers a structurally sound and commendably clear chronicle of the expedition's causal chain—particularly in grounding Shackleton’s ambition in the hard financial ledgers of Chapter 2. Its multi-track structure during the crisis phase effectively conveys the simultaneous struggles of different groups. However, the narrative texture can feel abstract where it should be concrete, with some later chapters drifting into retrospective summary rather than maintaining the gripping, scene-level immediacy established earlier. A more disciplined handling of",
